description:
Application pursuant to Section 96a of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for non-material amendments to planning permission ref. P062728, dated 15 Feb 2007, as amended by non-material amendment application ref. P2022/2665/NMA, dated 21 Mar 2023. The amendments sought are:

-The creation of an additional 81 sqm of Class E(g) (i) floorspace at ground floor level [Corner of Ropemaker Street and Moor Lane];  
-The creation of a new office conference facility at ground floor level (Class E (g)(i)) [Chiswell Street Elevation];  
-The provision of new amenity spaces for the use of both tenants and building visitors; and 
-Amendments to the Site's parking facilities, including the provision of new and improved end-of-trip facilities as well as:  
o A change in car-parking numbers from 19 to 9 (including 3no. accessible spaces); and 
o A change in motorcycle parking numbers from 73 to 34. 

It is also proposed to change the original description of development to;

The redevelopment of the Site to provide 82,806m2 gross external area (commercial (Class E(g)(i)) floorspace at the upper floors, flexible E(a)/E(b)/E(c) and flexible E(a)/E(b)/E(c)/E(g)(i) floorspace at ground floor level), within a building of up to 22 storeys, and including 3 basement levels, as well as parking for cars, motorcycles and bicycles.
